# The room-minimum goal completes when the minimum is shredded even while
# unrelated cubes are airborne.  Seek and Destroy 3's speed strategy relies
# on this: every losing candidate is being carried toward the hole.
name Shred Minimum While Held
dim 5 5
commands pickup if nearest giveto end
ent cube 1 2 1
ent cube 3 2 2
ent worker 1 2
ent worker 3 2
ent shredder 2 2
goal shred_min_room
